    <div class="wb-note">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M12 2L3 7v6c0 5.25 3.75 10.1 9 11 5.25-.9 9-5.75 9-11V7l-9-5z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
      <p><strong>Why this is safe.</strong> The local MCP server and every URL-invoke tool run on your machine or in your browser — pure functions over your input, no data stored or sent to us. The hosted worker is stateless and open source.</p>
